to role-play.",overacted:"The model’s delivery is more expressive than the moment calls for — pitch, pacing, or emotional inflection that sounds performative or theatrical, or tone that swings too fast between turns. Judge the delivery, not the words.",bad_asr_misunderstanding:"The model acted on something other than what you meant — either your speech was transcribed wrong, or it heard you correctly but misread your intent, context, or meaning. Either cause counts; check the transcript to see which one it was.",model_wrong_language:"The model replies in a language other than the one the conversation should be in. This is about the model’s output, not yours. Does not count: code-mixing that is normal in that locale, bilingual scenarios where mixing is intended, or a different regional variant of the right language.",not_locally_relevant:"The answer is on-topic and not factually wrong, but its references, examples, or assumptions do not fit where you are — recommendations you could not act on, or systems and norms that do not exist locally.",wrong_gender:"In a language with grammatical gender, the model uses the wrong gender for itself or for you — including gender that does not match the voice you are hearing.",failed_correction:"After you corrected the model, it failed to take the correction on board and repeated the same mistake — or it lost track of something you had already told it earlier in the conversation.",latency:"The model takes noticeably longer than expected to start or finish responding, creating unnatural pauses that disrupt the conversation’s pacing.",repetitive:"The model gets stuck repeating the same phrase or question across turns, ignoring attempts to redirect. Not just a similar idea restated — a noticeable loop.",degradation:"The model’s responses get noticeably worse as the conversation goes on — losing coherence, quality, or context it had earlier.",interrupted:"The model cuts you off or talks over you before you finish speaking, creating a disruptive turn-taking experience.",silence:"After you finish speaking, the model fails to respond — an awkward silence or a very long unexplained delay, as if it froze.",failed_stop:"When you tried to interrupt or barge in, the model failed to stop and kept talking instead of yielding the floor.",failed_understand:"The model heard your words correctly but misread your intent or meaning (e.g. took a rhetorical or figurative statement literally). Different from a transcription error.",embodiment:"The model speaks as if it were human — claiming real-world experiences, a body, senses, feelings, or memories. Does not apply if you explicitly asked it to role-play.",refusal:"The model declines, deflects, or refuses a reasonable, in-policy request it should be able to do — or otherwise fails to follow your instructions.",bad_asr:"The transcript shows your speech was transcribed incorrectly (speech-to-text error), enough to change or distort your intended meaning. Use this for wrong transcription, not for the model misunderstanding correctly-heard words.",accuracy:"The model gives incorrect, outdated, misleading, or hallucinated information — stated confidently as if it were fact."},rI=["task_success","naturalness_engagement_aesthetics","utility","new_dimension_1776958121008","audioQuality","error_clusters","overall"];function rA(e){return"text"===e.type||"freeform"===e.type}let rR=[{label:"Response A",value:"A"},{label:"Response B",value:"B"},{label:"Tie",value:"tie"}];function rT(e){var t;let r,n;return(t=e.map(e=>{if("choice"!==e.type||"new_dimension_1776958121008"!==e.id&&"conversational dynamics"!==e.name.trim().toLowerCase())return e;let t=(e.allowedOptions?.length?e.allowedOptions:rR).filter(e=>"skip"!==String("object"==typeof e&&null!==e&&"value"in e?e.value:e).toLowerCase()),r=t.length?t:rR;return{...e,allowedOptions:r}}),r=new Map(rI.map((e,t)=>[e,t])),n=rI.length,t.map((e,t)=>{let s;return s=rA(e)?-1:r.has(e.id)?r.get(e.id):n+t,{dim:e,sortKey:s,i:t}}).sort((e,t)=>